{
    "name": "agent-recipes",
    "title": "Agent recipes",
    "description": "Author recipe drafts in conversation, share owner-accepted snapshots, and start linked roles after owner confirmation or under a bounded conversation policy. Automatic use and status use experimental host-linked APIs; automatic use acts as the current source requester, not the authorizing owner. Reads only module documents, source settings and model metadata; no outside files or secrets, direct external network calls, or processes. Linked agents use normal tools and providers; work modes are instructions, not a sandbox.",
